'fire-vehicle-roadside' = 'It went up while I was driving it. I got out at the lights. | It runs on gas. There is a tank in the back of it. | I am insured. Just tell me what to do and I will do it.'
'fire-warehouse' = 'We do not know what is in there. It is pallet racking, all of it. | The last delivery was aerosols. That is all I can tell you. | The shutter is shut and it is hot to the touch. Do not open the shutter.'

