'p686-terrorist-attack' = 'It is still going on. Multiple callers and every one of them saying shots. | I need everything you have and I need it now. | Do not go in on your own. Do you hear me, do not go in on your own.'
'p686-traffic-stop-backup' = 'I have one male out of the vehicle and he is compliant. | It is the passenger who is the problem. He will not get out. | I am on the shoulder. Come up on my side.'
'p686-vehicle-on-sidewalk' = 'He went up the pavement to get past the queue. | There were people on that pavement. A woman with a pram stepped into the road. | He turned off at the next junction. He is still local.'
'p686-vip-evacuation' = 'The route has to be clear before the convoy moves. | I need a left turn and a clear run to the motorway. | If the route is not clear the convoy does not move. That is the whole of it.'

# ============================================================ Park Rangers
'sapr-bear-sighting' = 'It came into the camp about an hour ago and it has not gone far. | Nobody has been hurt. Everybody is in their tents. | It went for the food bin and then it just sat down.'
'sapr-campers-fire' = 'It is not ours. It was already going when we got here. | There are three tents inside the ring and nobody in them. | The wind is taking it towards the trees.'
'sapr-climber-stuck' = 'He is below the ridge and he will not move. | He says his leg has gone. He is talking, which is something. | You need the rope team. There is no way up that face otherwise.'
'sapr-drone-over-park' = 'It is over the nesting area. That is closed this month. | It has been up twenty minutes and it is filming the whole valley. | The operator is somewhere by the car park. That is where they always are.'
'sapr-dumped-chemicals' = 'Six drums and two of them are leaking. | It is at the beauty spot, right beside the picnic table. | Do not touch them. That is my advice and I am sticking to it.'
'sapr-dumping-park' = 'Somebody tipped a trailer load at the trailhead in the night. | There is no vehicle and there is nobody here now. | It is the third time this year at the same spot.'
'sapr-fire-lookout' = 'Smoke, three ridges over, and it is not camp smoke. | I have it from the tower and it is building. | If it gets over that ridge there is nothing to stop it.'
'sapr-illegal-campfire' = 'It is a fire ban. There are signs at every gate. | Three of them sat round it and they have been drinking. | They have seen me and they are not putting it out.'
'sapr-illegal-fishing' = 'They have got a net across the narrow end. | It is a protected lake and that net has been in since dusk. | Two of them and a boat. They know exactly what they are doing.'
'sapr-illegal-tour' = 'Twelve of them and a guide, all well off the marked path. | They are paying for it, that is why he does it. | They are heading for the falls, and the falls are closed.'
'sapr-injured-horse' = 'She is down at the bridge and she will not get up. | The rider is sat with her. The rider is fine, the horse is not. | There is a vet coming from town. That is an hour away.'
'sapr-injured-wildlife' = 'It is a deer and it is still alive on the verge. | Traffic is slowing right down to look at it. | Nobody has hit it twice. Not yet.'
'sapr-litter-fire' = 'The bin at the picnic area is alight and it has taken the table. | There is nobody here. It is shut for the season. | It is going towards the gorse and the gorse is dry.'
'sapr-lost-walker' = 'I am on a path but I do not know which one. | I can see a ridge to my left and water below it. | My battery is nearly gone. I am going to have to stop talking.'
'sapr-missing-swimmer' = 'He went in off the rocks half an hour ago. | His towel and his keys are still on the rock. | Nobody has seen him come out of the water.'
'sapr-off-roading' = 'There are two of them and neither is on the trail. | They have been across the protected ground. You can see the tracks. | They are heading up the fire road. That is where it comes out.'
'sapr-poaching-park' = 'Shots, after closing, from the treeline. | That is not a licensed hunter. The season ended a month ago. | Assume they are armed and assume they will run.'
'sapr-rockfall' = 'The trail is blocked and there are people above it. | Four of them, and they cannot come down this way. | It is still moving. Every few minutes another one comes down.'
'sapr-snake-bite' = 'It was on the path, in the shade. | It went for my calf and it was gone before I saw it properly. | I have put my leg up and I have not moved since.'
'sapr-tourist-lost' = 'There are four of us and two of them are children. | The phone is at four per cent. I am going to lose it. | We came off the trail where the sign was missing.'

# ============================================================ Highway Patrol
'sahp-abandoned-vehicle' = 'It has been there five days. It is not mine and it is not anybody round here. | No plates on it and the doors are unlocked. | Nobody has touched it. I have been watching it out of the window.'
'sahp-abnormal-load' = 'It is over the limit on width and it needs an escort to the county line. | Five miles an hour, and there is no way round it on that road. | One unit in front and one behind. That is what we agreed.'
'sahp-breakdown' = 'It is in a live lane with the hazards on and I cannot get it moving. | I am behind the barrier. I am not standing in the lane. | The recovery is twenty minutes out. That is a long twenty minutes.'
'sahp-breakdown-night' = 'There are no lights on it at all. None. | It is right over the crest and you do not see it until you are on top of it. | I have put my own car behind it with the lights on. That is all I can do.'
'sahp-bridge-stopped' = 'He is parked on the bridge and he is stood at the rail. | He has not done anything. He is just stood there looking at the water. | I am keeping well back. That is why I called you.'
'sahp-bus-collision' = 'I hit my head on the handrail. I was standing up. | The bus went into the back of the car and everybody came forward. | There are people in the aisle and two of them are not getting up.'
'sahp-cow-motorway' = 'It is on the carriageway and the traffic is doing seventy at it. | Two cars have already gone onto the hard shoulder to miss it. | I am not going out there on foot. Not for that.'
'sahp-cyclist-collision' = 'My shoulder. I went over the bonnet. | I had lights on and a jacket on. Ask the driver. | I am not moving off this kerb until somebody tells me I can.'
'sahp-debris' = 'It is across both lanes and nobody knows where it came from. | It is metal. Something has come off something. | People are swerving at the last second. It is going to happen.'
'sahp-drunk-driver' = 'I am two cars behind it and it cannot hold a lane. | It was twenty, then sixty, then twenty again. | It has just clipped the kerb. It is on the kerb now.'
'sahp-failing-to-stop' = 'It failed to stop about two minutes ago and it went east. | I did not get the driver. Only the vehicle. | I am not pursuing on my own. Not without authorisation.'
'sahp-fuel-spill' = 'It is diesel and it is across two lanes. | The spill came off the truck and the truck has gone. | There is a van coming up that hill. Somebody is going to slide.'
'sahp-hit-and-run' = 'It was a white van and it did not slow down. | The pedestrian is in the road and he is talking. | The van went north. It went north and it was still accelerating.'
'sahp-insecure-load' = 'It is shedding off the back every hundred yards. | It is timber and there is a lot of it. | The driver has pulled onto the shoulder and he is looking at it.'
'sahp-jackknife' = 'The trailer is across both lanes and the cab is in the barrier. | The driver is out and he is walking about. He is shaken. | Nobody is getting past. That is the top and bottom of it.'
'sahp-motorcycle-collision' = 'I am all right. I am all right. Is the bike all right? | He pulled out in front of me. He did not look. | I have got a cut on my arm. Nothing else. I am fine.'
'sahp-motorcycle-racing' = 'Three of them and they are doing well over a hundred. | They are going through the traffic like it is stood still. | They have just gone past a junction and they did not slow down for it.'
'sahp-overheight' = 'It has hit the bridge and it is wedged under it. | The roof of the trailer has gone back into the cab. | The driver is out and he is on the phone to his firm.'
'sahp-overloaded-pickup' = 'It is sitting on the bump stops and the load is not strapped. | There are sheets of steel on it and nothing holding them down. | It came past me and the whole truck was moving sideways.'
'sahp-overweight-lorry' = 'He failed the weight check and he was not polite about it. | I have got him stopped and he is arguing with me about the paperwork. | I need a second unit before I start on the load.'
'sahp-road-rage' = 'He cut me up at the junction and then he brake checked me. | We both got out. Neither of us threw anything. | He has gone back to his car. That is the part I am watching.'
'sahp-roadworks' = 'He went straight through the closure and the lads had to jump. | It is forty miles an hour through there and he did not brake. | The signs were up. They have been up all morning.'
'sahp-speeding-convoy' = 'Five of them, all running together. | They are changing lanes as a block. That is deliberate. | The cars are modified. You can hear them from here.'
'sahp-speeding-stop-backup' = 'I have one vehicle stopped and two occupants. | The driver is fine. It is the passenger who keeps reaching under the seat. | Second unit, come up on the offside.'
'sahp-stolen-plate' = 'Both plates were taken in the night and both were left on the ground. | I did not hear anything. Not a thing. | It is a clean removal. That is what they do now.'
'sahp-street-racing' = 'Two cars side by side at well over a hundred. | They have gone up the road towards the retail park. | There are people stood on the verge watching them. That is the worst of it.'
'sahp-truck-collision' = 'Two lorries and they are blocking everything. | One driver is out and the other one is still in the cab. | There is diesel on the road and a trailer across two lanes.'
'sahp-tunnel-breakdown' = 'There is a car stopped inside the tunnel and there is smoke coming off it. | The traffic behind is still coming in. Nobody has shut it off. | Get the tunnel closed. That is the thing that matters.'
'sahp-tunnel-fire' = 'It is alight inside and cars are still going past it. | The smoke is going along the roof. It is filling the tunnel. | Nobody has shut the tunnel at either end.'
'sahp-wrong-way' = 'It is coming straight at people with its headlights on. | Three callers now and every one of them saying the same thing. | Somebody is going to be killed. Somebody needs to shut that road.'
'sahp-wrong-way-motorway' = 'It is on the wrong side of the barrier and it is not slowing down. | It has gone past two junctions and nobody is stopping it. | Shut the carriageway. Shut it now.'
}
